#: serviceproviderdatadialog.cpp:434
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<title>Delete GTFS database</title><para>Do you really want to delete the "
"GTFS database? You will need to import the GTFS feed again to use this "
"service provider again.</para><para>By deleting the database %1 disk space "
"get freed.</para>"
